Z||000003||Pontiaddict||07-29-2001||06:41 PM||||I don't think that there's any major differeance between the 2 years that would keep you from being able to do it.<BR>The late 87's and 88 4 cyls have some revisions that would make it difficult to install into an 84 without a computer harness change.||||reg||1
Z||000004||DecadenceR||07-29-2001||07:00 PM||||As far as I know, you shouldn't have a problem as long as you keep the ECM from the transmission you are going to be using. The 84-86 dukes are the same, and in 87 I think that's when they went to DIS and the head is different.||||reg||1
